# Browsers whose own interface -- tabs, toolbar, menus -- Omarchy leaves alone.
# Chromium, Chrome, Brave and Helium are not here: Omarchy themes those
# itself with a managed BrowserThemeColor policy, which would override anything
# set in a profile. Each root is where that browser keeps its profiles, native
# and Flatpak; only roots that actually hold profiles are touched.
